  "solution": {
    "text": "Applying $\\mathrm{C}_{1}-\\mathrm{C}_{2}$ and $\\mathrm{C}_{2}-\\mathrm{C}_{3},$ we get\r\n$\\begin{aligned}\r\n\\text { Det. } &=\\left|\\begin{array}{ccc}\r\n25 & 21 & 219 \\\\\r\n15 & 27 & 198 \\\\\r\n21 & 17 & 181\r\n\\end{array}\\right|=\\left|\\begin{array}{ccc}\r\n4 & 21 & 9 \\\\\r\n-12 & 27 & -72 \\\\\r\n4 & 17 & 11\r\n\\end{array}\\right| \\\\\r\n=&\\left[\\begin{array}{llc}\r\n4 & 21 & 9 \\\\\r\n0 & 90 & -45 \\\\\r\n0 & -4 & 2\r\n\\end{array} \\mid\\left[\\mathrm{By} \\mathrm{R}_{2}+3 \\mathrm{R}_{1}, \\mathrm{R}_{3}-\\mathrm{R}_{1}\\right]\\right.\\\\\r\n=4(180-180)=0\r\n\\end{aligned}$",
